    "title": "<p>Diagnostic criteria for classic&nbsp;medulloblastoma, histologically defined</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Andrey Korshunov",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"width: 16.0cm; background: #DAEEF3; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"0\" width=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 2.25pt 0cm 2.25pt 0cm;\"><strong><em>Essential:</em></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 2.25pt 0cm 2.25pt 0cm;\">A medulloblastoma</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 2.25pt 0cm 2.25pt 0cm;\"><strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 10.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 10.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 2.25pt 0cm 2.25pt 0cm;\">Absence of histological features qualifying for the diagnosis of desmoplastic/nodular medulloblastoma or medulloblastoma with extensive nodularity</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 2.25pt 0cm 2.25pt 0cm;\"><strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 2.25pt 0cm 2.25pt 0cm;\">Absence of predominant areas with severe cytological anaplasia and/or large cell cytology</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.2pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 2.25pt 0cm 2.25pt 0cm;\"><strong>AND</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 16.0cm; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"605\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin: 2.25pt 0cm 2.25pt 0cm;\">Retained expression of SMARCB1 (INI1)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
